# Apaxir Store Leads — Privacy Policy

Last updated: 8 September 2026

Apaxir Store Leads is an internal research tool that aggregates publicly
available information about e-commerce businesses (store domains, product
catalogs, and public advertising activity).

**What we collect.** Only publicly available business information. We do not
collect, store, or process personal data of app users. We do not request any
Facebook user permissions beyond basic public profile for authentication.

**How we use it.** To compile aggregated market research for e-commerce
professionals.

**Third-party data.** Data from Meta's Ad Library is accessed via the official
API in accordance with Meta's Platform Terms and used for research purposes only.

**Data deletion.** To request removal of any information, contact us at the
email below and we will respond within 30 days.

